Package: rjsf
Title: R Interface to Jump-Switch-Flow Simulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Thanh Long",
      family = "Vu",
      email = "longvu2000.work@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides an R interface to the Python 'jsf' package for
    Jump-Switch-Flow simulation of compartmental reaction models. It supports
    model definition in R, simulation through 'reticulate', and structured
    outputs for inspection, summarisation, and plotting.
